# Deny everything, then allow only what the image needs. An allow-list keeps a
# stray virtualenv or dataset out of the build context by default.
*
!src/
!configs/
!scripts/
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!artifacts/model.pkl
!artifacts/metrics/baseline.json
!artifacts/model_card.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
